The first comparison changes Ose3→30 and Belial80→50. The second changes Morax30→36, Focalor30→3, Vine36→35 and Valac38→30. All remaining primary counts agree with the uploaded vector. Superscript note numbers and bracketed editorial alternatives are excluded from the selected main reading but retained in source context. Paimon’s200primary and25accompanying legions remain separate. The2675one-edit hybrid is not another complete witness. No total here determines disjoint personnel.

